Notes
-----
- `claude --version` to check the installed build.
- `claude doctor` from a shell for the summary above; `/doctor` inside a
  session for the full checkup that can also fix issues.
- `claude --resume <session-id>` to pick a session back up.
- Remote Control: sessions can be driven from claude.ai/code or the mobile app.
- User settings live at %USERPROFILE%\.claude\settings.json
- Session transcripts live under %USERPROFILE%\.claude\projects
